							Whether you need an <strong>x word counter</strong> or a <strong>twitter character counter</strong>, every character counts. Our tool functions perfectly as a <strong>twitter word counter</strong>, <strong>instagram word counter</strong>, and <strong>linkedin word counter</strong>.
